OBJECTIVE & EVALUATION CRITERIA Build a 100% parametric, watertight manifold 3D solid model of a push-in snowthrower ignition key (named HandleBody [KEY]) in Autodesk Fusion 360 (Parametric Design Mode, Units: mm) using the Fusion 360 Python API or live MCP/Add-In commands.}
\par \pard\plain \s18\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\fi0\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\ltrpar{\loch
