) handle_neck_width = guard_width - (2 * handle_guard_offset) (mm) -- Tapered neck width at guard rear face (14.50 mm, Y = +/- 7.25 mm) handle_height = 17.00 (mm) -- Maximum rear vertical thickness of grip (Z = +/- 8.50 mm) handle_min_height = guard_height - (2 * handle_guard_offset) (mm) -- Tapered vertical thickness at guard rear face (7.50 mm, Z = +/- 3.75 mm) handle_pocket_depth = 2.00 (mm) -- Sloped finger grip pocket depth per face lanyard_hole_dia = 9.00 (mm) -- Through-hole diameter centered at X = -18.60 mm, Y = 0 junction_fillet_rad = 0.25 (mm) -- Stress-relief fillet at component seams, inner web corners, and outer stem rails}
\par \pard\plain \s2\rtlch\af8\afs36\ab \ltrch\hich\af3\loch\ilvl1\outlinelevel1\sb200\sa120\keepn\f3\fs36\b\dbch\af7\fi0\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\ltrpar{\loch
DETAILED COMPONENT GEOMETRY (+Y / +Z QUADRANT -> DOUBLE MIRROR)}
\par \pard\plain \s18\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain  1.\tab}\ilvl0\ls3 \fi-283\li0\lin0\tx709\fi-283\li709\lin709\ri0\rin0\ltrpar{\loch
COMPONENT STEM (X = 0.00 to +33.50 mm)}
\par \pard\plain \s18\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af5 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\f5\dbch\af5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls4 \fi-283\li0\lin0\tx709\fi-283\li709\lin709\ri0\rin0\ltrpar{\loch
Base Blade (StemSize on XY): Quadrant rectangle (0, 0) to (33.50, 4.75) with the 6.00 x 6.00 mm locking window quadrant cutout (X = 22.00 to 28.00 mm, Y = 0 to 3.00 mm). Extrude along +Z by stem_thickness / 2 (2.05 mm).}
\par \pard\plain \s18\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af5 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\f5\dbch\af5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls4 \fi-283\li0\lin0\tx709\fi-283\li709\lin709\ri0\rin0\ltrpar{\loch
Web, Concave Detent, Double-Chisel Window & Single-Plane Nose (StemCuts on XZ): a) Recessed Web (X = 0 to 14.00 mm): Cut across stem_internal_width / 2 (3.35 mm) down to Z = 0.65 mm (stem_internal_thickness / 2), leaving a 1.40 mm (stem_edge_rim) outer side rail. b) Concave Detent (X = 14.00 to 18.00 mm): A concave 3-point arc curving inward toward Z = 0 to a minimum height of Z = 0.30 mm at X = 16.00 mm (0.60 mm full bridge after mirroring) and returning to Z = 0.65 mm at X = 18.00 mm. c) Front Chisel Taper (X = 18.00 to 22.00 mm): Linear taper from Z = 0.65 mm at X = 18.00 mm down to a sharp chisel edge at Z = 0 at X = 22.00 mm. d) Full Window Clearance (X = 22.00 to 28.00 mm): Cut all the way to Z = 0 across the full 3.35 mm (stem_internal_width / 2) pocket width so zero protruding ledges remain inside the 6.00 mm window walls. e) Inner Tip Diamond (X = 28.00 to 30.75 mm): Cut across stem_internal_width / 2 (3.35 mm) starting from Z = 0 at X = 28.00 mm and rising linearly to Z = 2.05 mm (stem_tip_diamond_thk / 2) at X = 30.75 mm, meeting the outer 1.40 mm side rail flush. f) Full-Width Single-Plane Nose Slope (X = 30.75 to 33.50 mm): Cut across the full quadrant width stem_width / 2 (4.75 mm) sloping linearly from Z = 2.05 mm at X = 30.75 mm down to Z = 0 at X = 33.50 mm as one continuous flat surface.}
\par \pard\plain \s18\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain  2.\tab}\ilvl0\ls5 \fi-283\li0\lin0\tx709\fi-283\li709\lin709\ri0\rin0\ltrpar{\loch
COMPONENT GUARD (X = 0.00 to -3.00 mm)}
\par \pard\plain \s18\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af5 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\f5\dbch\af5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls6 \fi-283\li0\lin0\tx709\fi-283\li709\lin709\ri0\rin0\ltrpar{\loch
Collar Quadrant (GuardSize on YZ): Rectangle (0, 0) to (9.00, 5.50) extruded -3.00 mm (-guard_length) along -X, with a 1.50 mm (guard_corner_rad) fillet on the outer axial corner (Y = 9.00, Z = 5.50).}
\par \pard\plain \s18\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain  3.\tab}\ilvl0\ls7 \fi-283\li0\lin0\tx709\fi-283\li709\lin709\ri0\rin0\ltrpar{\loch
COMPONENT HANDLE (X = -3.00 to -27.00 mm)}
\par \pard\plain \s18\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af5 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\f5\dbch\af5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls8 \fi-283\li0\lin0\tx709\fi-283\li709\lin709\ri0\rin0\ltrpar{\loch
Tapered Grip Quadrant (SideCut on XZ + TopCutSketch on XY): Extrude quadrant profile (X = -3.00 mm, Z = 3.75 mm to X = -27.00 mm, Z = 8.50 mm) along +Y by handle_width / 2 (13.50 mm), trim the outer plan wedge (X = -3.00 mm, Y = 7.25 mm to X = -27.00 mm, Y = 13.50 mm) via Cut, and apply a 2.50 mm fillet to the rear vertical corner (X = -27.00, Y = 13.50).}
\par \pard\plain \s18\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af5 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\f5\dbch\af5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls8 \fi-283\li0\lin0\tx709\fi-283\li709\lin709\ri0\rin0\ltrpar{\loch
Sloped Finger Pocket (PocketPlan on XY): Trapezoidal quadrant pocket (X = -7.00 mm, Y = 0..5.50 mm to X = -24.00 mm, Y = 0..11.00 mm) offset-cut 2.00 mm (handle_pocket_depth) parallel to the slanted top handle face.}
\par \pard\plain \s18\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain  4.\tab}\ilvl0\ls9 \fi-283\li0\lin0\tx709\fi-283\li709\lin709\ri0\rin0\ltrpar{\loch
TWO-AXIS MIRROR (XY & XZ), LANYARD HOLE, COMBINE & FINISHING FILLETS}
\par \pard\plain \s18\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af5 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\f5\dbch\af5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls10 \fi-283\li0\lin0\tx709\fi-283\li709\lin709\ri0\rin0\ltrpar{\loch
Mirror STEM, GUARD, and HANDLE quadrants across XY (Z = 0) and XZ (Y = 0) to form full symmetric bodies.}
\par \pard\plain \s18\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af5 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\f5\dbch\af5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls10 \fi-283\li0\lin0\tx709\fi-283\li709\lin709\ri0\rin0\ltrpar{\loch
Cut the 9.00 mm (lanyard_hole_dia) through-hole centered at X = -18.60 mm, Y = 0 and apply a 0.40 mm rim fillet.}
\par \pard\plain \s18\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af5 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\f5\dbch\af5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls10 \fi-283\li0\lin0\tx709\fi-283\li709\lin709\ri0\rin0\ltrpar{\loch
Combine (Join) STEM and GUARD into HandleBody [KEY].}
\par \pard\plain \s18\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af5 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\f5\dbch\af5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls10 \fi-283\li0\lin0\tx709\fi-283\li709\lin709\ri0\rin0\ltrpar{\loch
Apply finishing fillets: a) 1.00 mm (guard_perimeter_rad) around the front (X = 0) and rear (X = -3.00 mm) outer perimeter loops of the guard collar. b) 1.00 mm around the 10 outer grip border edges of the handle (excluding the guard joint and finger pocket interior). c) 0.25 mm (junction_fillet_rad) stress-relief fillets along: (1) the STEM-GUARD and GUARD-HANDLE interface seams, (2) the inner 90-degree longitudinal pocket roots and top inner rail lips of STEM, and (3) the 4 outer longitudinal edges of STEM (Y = +/- 4.75 mm, Z = +/- 2.05 mm from X = 0 to 30.75 mm).}
